        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The storage engine is the bottom of the stack: it owns the question \"where do the actual bytes\nlive, and how do I get them in and out of memory efficiently?\" Everything above it — indexes,\ntransactions, the optimizer — assumes this layer just works."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-STORAGE-ENGINES.md#002",
